        "As x tends to infinity, e^(-2x) tends to 0, so (2x + 1)e^(-2x) tends to 0.",
        "So y^2 tends to 2^3 = 8.",
        "Since y >= 0, the horizontal asymptote is y = sqrt(8) = 2 sqrt(2)."
